@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN
@id = 1

### Login (copiar token a la variable)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"nombreUsuario":"admin","password":"Demo123!"}

### Crear
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titulo":"Correo no disponible","descripcion":"No permite iniciar sesión","prioridad":"Alta"}

### Listar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Asignar técnico
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes/{{id}}/asignar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tecnicoId":2}

### Avanzar (luego repetir con Resuelto y Cerrado)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes/{{id}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"EnProceso"}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sin token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes

### Intento de salto: 400 si no está Resuelto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/incidentes/{{id}}/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"estado":"Cerrado"}
